OL,3,AUS announces new tariffs on host of
OL,4,Acountries including China
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has announced a fresh raft of
OL,7,Ftariffs as President Donald Trump
OL,8,Fpushes ahead with his signature trade
OL,9,Fpolicy.
OL,11,FThe new taxes charged on imports to
OL,12,FAmerica are set to hit many of
OL,13,Fcountry's biggest trading partners,
OL,14,Fwith China, the European Union and 12
OL,15,Fother jurisdictions.
OL,17,FThe move comes after the White House's
OL,18,Finvestigation into the trade practices
OL,19,Fof other countries in March after the
OL,20,FUS Supreme Court ruled Trump's
OL,21,Fpreviously announced Liberation Day
OL,22,Ftariffs were illegal.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
